Topic Identification:
1) Prepare text for topic identification. 
  a) It should include summary, synopsis, and any other kind of description that can help to identify topics. 
  b) Add as many details as possible, use adverbs and adjectives.
  c) The text should be a meaningful piece of information, not just a compilation of different things.
  d) No more than 5 sentences
1) Call search_topics with the text
2) Use the search_topics tool output for the response part about topics as is
